Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Relate integrations, customer configurations, examples, and runbooks to the changed behavior. Identify implicit reliance such as ordering or retry assumptions, and preserve uncertain dependencies for targeted replay rather than declaring them unaffected.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
